WEBVTT

00:34:29.860 --> 00:34:32.612
They have community,
but they also have a siege mentality,

00:34:32.636 --> 00:34:34.997
a mentality that they're
completely under assault,

00:34:35.021 --> 00:34:36.422
which I think is exaggerated.

00:34:36.446 --> 00:34:39.705
Once you have a siege mentality,
once it's us-them, once it's tribal,

00:34:39.729 --> 00:34:42.976
you're willing to tolerate a leader
who violates all your principles,

00:34:43.000 --> 00:34:45.686
which is what they've done
in signing up to Donald Trump.

00:34:45.710 --> 00:34:51.796
You also, on the right, had an orthodoxy
which was economically free market,

00:34:51.820 --> 00:34:54.937
which actually undermined community.

00:34:54.961 --> 00:34:58.152
I was William F. Buckley's --
he was my mentor.

00:34:58.176 --> 00:35:01.406
And at "National Review" in the old days,
we had a sort of a tension